ver", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3d324b4da3ad05a37e2108d73d2d0bf949f96dca", "message": "Add Zenodo badge to README.md", "created_at": "2017-11-15T09:36:03Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8b106065ea120861852499b8a3096e6b3b8d1cec", "message": "Update configs to new format\n\n* add \"headers\"", "created_at": "2017-11-15T09:31:20Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ab17bbd2f00a27ab6541d2caa4cd5bebd057467", "message": "Update config format to support custom headers\n\n* custom headers are needed to retrieve data using the GitHub API during the \"API preview period\"\n* we were interested in retrieving the license for GitHub repos, see https://developer.github.com/v3/licenses/, which is an \"API preview\" feature\n* update config format accordingly\n* if an filtered field is None, the string \"None\" is returned (e.g., if there is now license provided for the requested GitHub repo)", "created_at": "2017-11-15T09:29:35Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d87633e3e0e162e80d8c97cf2aa63579dce7d2f9", "message": "Update gitignore\n\n* ignore Python files", "created_at": "2017-08-08T07:22:01Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f82056340cc75e75c0e393a7bd641ede06a5a44", "message": "Update gitignore\n\n* ignore OS-generated files\n* ignore IDE-files\n* remove generated patterns from GitHub", "created_at": "2017-08-08T07:19:05Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4db79b1cfe24f13e3bb8b61246054835ff1601c9", "message": "Added short description to README.", "created_at": "2017-06-14T07:52:11Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b815cc8870f393d70b9c867794aea9ed2996cd81", "message": "Added new entity configuration to retrieve data about SO answers.\n* added JSON config\n* modified filter function to support integer list indices\n* it us now possible to use URIs for input parameters", "created_at": "2017-06-12T08:56:52Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "961ed1a0744bcc9f4079b0267e5b792bfc4c1ec9", "message": "Added new entity configuration to get a GH user's email address from his/her commits to a repo.", "created_at": "2017-06-10T15:31:03Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6dc8ac68a1de860b59041623cbf535d34f78a5e3", "message": "Setting start_index and chunk_size makes no sense for chained requests (different number of entities).", "created_at": "2017-06-10T14:11:33Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dafbebc44a65e0e1ee22a6257350150c8787a193", "message": "Now checking if API key is configured when needed, reading input file in chunks now possible.", "created_at": "2017-06-10T14:09:34Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b520c0242e900b1dc3dd8f614f1046daf45ef398", "message": "Added new entity config to retrieve type and email address of GH users.", "created_at": "2017-06-10T13:23:52Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "237678a79d40599fddee17f4071b16a263d46c10", "message": "Added new entity config to check if GH repos are forks.", "created_at": "2017-06-10T10:43:49Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a012d5ab800fce8ed0af6526f28b44a3f0dd6539", "message": "* exporting raw content to output files now possible", "created_at": "2017-06-09T07:56:56Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d57bf74c9499113791c6e87e363bfef54a0a93d7", "message": "* changed configuration parameters:\n    \"ignore_duplicates -> ignore_input_duplicates\"\n    new parameter \"apply_output_filter\"\n* started implementation of option to save raw response", "created_at": "2017-06-08T08:26:16Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2a3fdf73b7d6c47f9a5fb65d24563b00d7cdbc5d", "message": "* added new configuration for retrieving default branches of GH repos", "created_at": "2017-06-06T07:21:20Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7bf8cb26805d50e198195b8f6831e4926c568f7b", "message": "* now also tracking sample configuration files\n* added new GH API retriever that searches for particular source code lines in commits (\"gh_repo_path_line_url___commits\")", "created_at": "2017-06-05T18:45:46Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "741077a2fba1436e42c3255ff1fdf7255ba47313", "message": "* implemented new naming convention (application_input-vars___output-vars)", "created_at": "2017-06-05T14:59:10Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "125c9455f9c433c4210a0d45caf44a1b361fc522", "message": "* added missing chained configuration file", "created_at": "2017-06-05T14:15:22Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d4d35a4d6c1a251bcf645c9d0f78290b2a7b522f", "message": "* ported Airbnb sample configurations to new format\n* post_request_callbacks can now be used to filter an EntityList\n* implemented sample GitHub configuration with chained request and filter callback\n* parameters that are both input and output parameters are now automatically validated before exporting the entities\n* now using ordered dictionaries and sets\n* updated docstring comments\n* refactorings", "created_at": "2017-04-17T15:46:52Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "990ffe08db0c49fd551f8a273657428ad4929568", "message": "* reading an entity configuration from JSON is now a factory method\n* validation is now done using callbacks, not special input parameters\n* parameter extraction is now always done (not a callback anymore)", "created_at": "2017-04-14T12:35:43Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b16e9c5e1bb5a20c7ecffba907cb448bb52cc63d", "message": "* now distinguishing between pre_ and post_request_callbacks\n* refactorings\n* added method to normalize Java code\n* now considering number of parameters when calling callbacks", "created_at": "2017-04-14T09:43:22Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "effe1941863ef4819dd429a00442779b2c17f3eb", "message": "* it is now possible to register multiple response callbacks that are executed in the configured order\n* renamed default response callback\n* renamed GitHub sample configuration", "created_at": "2017-04-13T16:23:38Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77083a76f737974b795dec6f2989a1ad133cfacb", "message": "* moved handling of uri templates to separate module\n\ncallbacks.py:\n   * started implementation of new callback for gh_snippet_commits\n   * added docstring comment for helper function _filter_json", "created_at": "2017-04-13T15:28:40Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f51f2ae573077c1911033f477fa4ba74ed6212c", "message": "* added regular expression needed for extraction of variables from an uri template", "created_at": "2017-04-13T14:42:28Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1cd2bc9745afef1b07b8f65bdc1706dde470368a", "message": "* added sample configuration for retrieving commits using GitHub API\n* switched from module URITemplate to regex-based approach for replacing variables in uri templates, because the module escapes the content of the variables, which breaks how we handle the template for the GitHub API\n* moved deserialization of JSON strings from callbacks to Entity, because we only support JSON responses anyway\n* the access paths in the output parameter mapping can now start with an asterisk to indicate a list of values for a certain parameter", "created_at": "2017-04-13T14:40:44Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4aca02e3eebd89f719c1639cfbcd25a5dd9abf0c", "message": "* added sample configuration files", "created_at": "2017-04-13T12:35:10Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "406f7b9982a2e1fa03ede6744ec9f71a79e540cd", "message": "* renamed some configuration parameters\n* the extraction of parameters from a response is now handled by a callback function\n* Entity.retrieve_data now returns True and False instead of 1 and 0", "created_at": "2017-04-13T12:22:23Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fd9b8d38a87f1cb03b4eee2df4698750e140a70e", "message": "* new configuration option \"flatten_lists\" to flatten list parameters\n* fixed bug in parameter validation (validation failed due to different data types)\n* improved logging", "created_at": "2017-04-12T14:23:44Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "03002ef4890cdbe8955b381b88218adf6f76d07c", "message": "* added name to entity configuration\n* fixed bug in handling of access path during data retrieval (bug caused whole JSON string to be stored for all parameters)\n* implemented export of EntityList to CSV file", "created_at": "2017-04-12T13:26:51Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c7fe1e6d18924e24aaece81a09fdd450673c31da", "message": "* it is now possible to configure a randomized delay between requests\n* refactorings", "created_at": "2017-04-12T12:50:55Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0b2159eeb7d9f5b3e1360440458d7c172dd995f2", "message": "initial commit with:\n  * data model (EntityConfiguration, Entity, and EntityList)\n  * logging\n  * custom exceptions\n  * updated gitignore", "created_at": "2017-04-12T12:18:42Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5413d6792484ac371e83c85d4771df4842614a58", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2017-04-10T08:47:31Z", "repo": "api-retriever", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "096beec66cf2661b6f2444043d708398595845f1", "message": "Modified git log options./n* now also printing commiter information (beside author)", "created_at": "2017-06-13T11:59:36Z", "repo": "fst_ws1617_exercises", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a019cbe779ab98a05bf8db5f23c7cce8892f4237", "message": "Now saving both merge logs and commit logs.", "created_at": "2017-06-10T10:28:57Z", "repo": "fst_ws1617_exercises", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "df57fcb9ca0d9e21f5c1a2928c1f844409d778fc", "message": "Now also writing project name to branch CSVs (to be able to easily merge them later).", "created_at": "2017-06-10T09:38:22Z", "repo": "fst_ws1617_exercises", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab5aa48af5e8af5e6f0380351aa6dd4e13f1c010", "message": "Fixed command.", "created_at": "2017-06-